Compare a flight log with its simulation (not available yet)

Usage: hpr compare [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json          Print one JSON document on standard output instead of text, errors included
      --color <WHEN>  When to use color. With auto, output to a terminal is colored, and NO_COLOR, FORCE_COLOR and CLICOLOR_FORCE are followed. JSON output never has color [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
  -h, --help          Print help
  -V, --version       Print version
